       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. armstrong-numbers.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       REPOSITORY. FUNCTION ALL INTRINSIC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NUMBER PIC X(8).
       01 WS-DIGITS REDEFINES WS-NUMBER.
         03 WS-DIGIT PIC 9 OCCURS 8 TIMES 
            INDEXED BY WS-DIGIT-INDEX.
       01 WS-NUMBER-DIGITS PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-DIGITS-MAX PIC 9.
       01 WS-SPACE-COUNTER PIC 9.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-POWERED PIC 10(18).
       01 WS-RESULT PIC 9.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       ARMSTRONG-NUMBERS.
        INITIALIZE WS-SPACE-COUNTER, WS-TOTAL, WS-RESULT.
        IF WS-NUMBER EQUAL TO 0
         MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT
         EXIT PARAGRAPH
        END-IF.
      
        MOVE WS-NUMBER TO WS-NUMBER-DIGITS.
        INSPECT WS-NUMBER TALLYING WS-SPACE-COUNTER FOR TRAILING SPACE.
        SUBTRACT WS-SPACE-COUNTER FROM 8 GIVING WS-DIGITS-MAX.
        SET WS-DIGIT-INDEX TO 1.
        PERFORM WS-DIGITS-MAX TIMES
         COMPUTE WS-POWERED = WS-DIGIT(WS-DIGIT-INDEX) ** WS-DIGITS-MAX
         ADD WS-POWERED TO WS-TOTAL
         SET WS-DIGIT-INDEX UP BY 1
        END-PERFORM.
       
        IF WS-TOTAL EQUAL TO WS-NUMBER-DIGITS
         MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT
        END-IF.
              